    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859270/extras/d6e4a93e494169e0ff2eef80c48cedd2.avif?t=1729269373\" width=628 height=100 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859270/extras/97ce81df215106e652cfb1d562f50c08.avif?t=1729269373\" width=480 height=90 /></span><br>Your peaceful holiday is interrupted when the small village you\u2019re staying in becomes terrorized by strange lights roaming the night and bizarre cattle mutilations. Enigmatic men in black are stalking the villagers, and some have gone missing.<br><br>You are their only chance to find them.<br><br>Will you be able to save everyone and learn what is really happening when the sun goes down?<br>Prepare yourself for an mystery that will follow you home.<br>This could happen to you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859270/extras/95578922fbb1f8e402a035ec22c4099d.avif?t=1729269373\" width=480 height=90 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive, thrilling story with a branching narrative and multiple endings.<br></li><li>Multiple locations to explore, with a day-and-night cycle.<br></li><li>Unique retro visual style that mixes pixel art with photography.<br></li><li>Original 80\u2019s creepy synth soundtrack.<br></li><li>Point-and-click mechanics.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859270/extras/d6e4a93e494169e0ff2eef80c48cedd2.avif?t=1729269373\" width=628 height=100 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859270/extras/97ce81df215106e652cfb1d562f50c08.avif?t=1729269373\" width=480 height=90 /></span><br>Your peaceful holiday is interrupted when the small village you\u2019re staying in becomes terrorized by strange lights roaming the night and bizarre cattle mutilations. Enigmatic men in black are stalking the villagers, and some have gone missing.<br><br>You are their only chance to find them.<br><br>Will you be able to save everyone and learn what is really happening when the sun goes down?<br>Prepare yourself for an mystery that will follow you home.<br>This could happen to you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859270/extras/95578922fbb1f8e402a035ec22c4099d.avif?t=1729269373\" width=480 height=90 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immersive, thrilling story with a branching narrative and multiple endings.<br></li><li>Multiple locations to explore, with a day-and-night cycle.<br></li><li>Unique retro visual style that mixes pixel art with photography.<br></li><li>Original 80\u2019s creepy synth soundtrack.<br></li><li>Point-and-click mechanics.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Your peaceful holiday is interrupted when the small village you\u2019re visiting in becomes terrorized by strange lights on the sky and enigmatic men in black. Some villagers have gone missing, everyone is afraid. Dive into a thrilling adventure with branching narrative and a unique visual style.",
